  "cves": [
    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-96658",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-01T16:23:23.688Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-01T23:25:10.744Z",
      "description": "A flaw was found in Foreman. An authenticated attacker with low-level permissions can achieve remote code execution (RCE) by bypassing the safemode sandbox within the templating engine. Due to improper handling of delegated methods, an attacker can append unauthorized functions to the allowed execution list, enabling them to run arbitrary commands on the hosting server.",
      "severity": 9.9,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Red Hat Red Hat Satellite 6.16 for RHEL 8\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
