    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-12541",
      "publishedDate": "2026-10-01T16:22:09.928Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-10-01T23:25:54.082Z",
      "description": "A flaw was found in Foreman. OS command injection vulnerabilities exist in the foreman-rake db:dump and db:import_dump tasks. The application fails to properly sanitize user-supplied input in the destination parameter (during backups) and the file parameter (during imports) before passing them to a Ruby system() call for execution. An attacker with permissions to execute foreman-rake (e.g., via a restricted sudo configuration) can append malicious shell commands to the provided file paths.",
      "severity": 8.2,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：Red Hat Red Hat Satellite 6.16 for RHEL 8\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:74503",
          "type": "reference"
